      "note": "V21-V27 deep dive: all engineering bugs fixed (inplace ops, decoder unfreeze, dtype mismatch). Core issue: Data Distribution Shift \u2014 Infinigen gripper signals are continuous-gradual (1.0->-1.0 over ~5 steps) while MINT VQ-VAE expects discrete binary (-1/+1). Plus strict_rollout_criteria requires grasp_steps>=5 but teacher data only has 1-2 steps.",
