        "v26": "Added direct_grip_head (2-ch sigmoid), fixed dtype mismatch. GRIP DEBUG revealed: direct_grip_head outputs logits +6-8 -> always predicts OPEN.",
        "v27": "Smart gripper override (only override when VQ-VAE also outputs OPEN). Still always OPEN -> override always triggers. Still 0% grasp."
      },
      "root_causes_identified": [
        "P0: Teacher data grasp_steps=1-2 but strict_rollout_criteria requires >=5. Standard-data mismatch.",
